["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"93. 离开字节、MiniMax的张前川，发出AGI对人类威胁的预警 PageRank PGC baby AGI UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-20-zhangxiaojun-agi-是人类的最后一个发明-但-95-的公司在踩油门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0671266ee01a3b9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是人类的最后一个发明，但 95% 的公司在踩油门</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张前川把人类文明比作开出 1 万公里的车，AGI 是最后一公里：前方可能是更宽的公路，也可能是悬崖。而绝大多数 AI 公司正在做的是疯狂踩油门。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">内容分发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"92. 和张亚勤院士聊，意识、寿命、机器人、生物智能和物种的延伸 RS2 corner case end-to-end world model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-17-zhangxiaojun-张亚勤-信息智能五年到顶-人形机器人还要十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af271912f6614eec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">53:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>张亚勤：信息智能五年到顶，人形机器人还要十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把 AGI 拆成信息、物理、生物三层：信息智能五年内达到人类水平，但那是大脑的智商；读万卷书仍不会游泳，物理智能才刚开场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"91. 逐篇讲解DeepSeek关键9篇论文及创新点——“勇敢者的游戏” MoE MLA MTP FP8 PPO rule-based reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-11-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用-2000-张卡训出-671b-模型-靠的是敢赌没人做过的技/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e697ec31e81cd26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用 2000 张卡训出 671B 模型，靠的是敢赌没人做过的技术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 的每一步创新都是被成本逼出来的：从 MoE 到 MLA 到 FP8 训练，别人不敢在大规模上试的东西，他们试了，而且一次训完没回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90. 朱啸虎又来了：中国现实主义AIGC故事的1周年连载 Scaling Law RL DAU PMF Capex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-07-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎改口-deepseek-让他快信-agi-了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd200744fc07602d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>朱啸虎改口：DeepSeek 让他快信 AGI 了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一年前他说绝不投任何一家中国大模型公司，如今他说如果梁文锋开放融资「我肯定会投」，价格已经不太重要，关键是参与见证人类 AGI 和 AI 意识的产生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"89. 逐句讲解DeepSeek-R1、Kimi K1.5、OpenAI o1技术报告——“最优美的算法最干净” GRPO reward hacking PRM MCTS distillation curriculum sampling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-04-zhangxiaojun-r1-最值钱的不是模型-是那个-aha-moment/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/acc6341cf0407e5d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>R1 最值钱的不是模型，是那个 aha moment</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 把 O1 出的谜语第一个解开了：不用人教，模型自己在强化学习里学会反思和纠错。R1-Zero 比 R1 更干净，但 R1 才是能用的那个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"88. 和吴翼技术解读OpenAI Operator：推理从抽象世界走向物理世界的开端 CUA GUI agent close loop system OS World\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-24-zhangxiaojun-operator-不是-o3-的延续-是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55d0a72f1e4b0469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>Operator 不是 O3 的延续，是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 2016 年做 Web Agent 失败并裁掉二三十人，缺的是基座模型；十年后 Operator 把基座模型、人类数据和强化学习三件事凑齐，才让推理从抽象文本走向视觉交互。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"87. 对李想的3小时访谈（播客版）：宅男、AI、家庭、游戏和天梯 VLA VLM MPI BLM DT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-02-zhangxiaojun-李想-汽车是物理世界ai最大的应用-但l4门票要三样东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d61119d6a5d51c08-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>李想：汽车是物理世界AI最大的应用，但L4门票要三样东西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把AI产品分三段：增强能力、成为助手、成为家人。今天连第一段都没做好，所以真正的竞争还没开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产品</span><span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How NVIDIA&#x27;s Jensen Huang Wants to be Remembered CUDA Omniverse Cosmos transformer attention mechanism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-cleo-abram-黄仁勋-gpu-是时间机器-机器人将无处不在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00404ce6eac0bc76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cleo Abram</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：GPU 是时间机器，机器人将无处不在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NVIDIA 的核心赌注不是「造更快的芯片」，而是押注深度学习架构可以无限扩展，并且这个判断二十年没变过，才撑起了 CUDA 十年无回报的投入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang on GPUs - Computerphile CUDA Tensor Core NVLink Amdahl&#x27;s Law scale up / scale out AI RAN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-computerphile-黄仁勋-ai让芯片算力十年涨了一百万倍而非摩尔定律预测的百倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd0f3e4a826d44f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Computerphile</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI让芯片算力十年涨了一百万倍而非摩尔定律预测的百倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋说预打包软件曾把算力的进步死死按在摩尔定律的节奏里，而CUDA让算法、精度和芯片可以同时重新设计，过去十年算力因此涨了约一百万倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GPU</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"A Conversation with Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang | Global Conference 2025 token physical AI AI factory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-milken-institute-黄仁勋-ai不是替代it-而是在创造数字劳动力补上劳动力缺口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0f90f164b386af8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">29:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Milken Institute</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI不是替代IT，而是在创造数字劳动力补上劳动力缺口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋认为AI工厂生产的是「token」，本质是在人类面对劳动力短缺时新增一支数字劳动力，而不是简单的下一代IT工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Nvidia</span><span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neuralink Update, Summer 2025 BCI ASIC BPS hand knob neural non-stationarity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-neuralink-穿刺针成本从350美元降到15美元-植入正在变成流水线作业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b9ed33b1bc91df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Neuralink</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>穿刺针成本从350美元降到15美元，植入正在变成流水线作业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去一年里 Neuralink 把机器人插入每根电极的时间从17秒压到1.5秒，穿刺针组件成本从350美元砍到15美元，这才是比动画演示更能说明进度的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脑机接口</span><span class=\"tag\">医疗科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk talks SpaceX Starship&#x27;s potential to transform space exploration in new update Gigabay\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-videofromspace-马斯克-火星自给自足不是建芯片厂-而是建造厂的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c494a46353996b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">21:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">VideoFromSpace</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：火星自给自足不是建芯片厂，而是建造厂的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Starship的终极目标是让火星城市能在地球补给断绝后独立存活，这要求的不只是工厂，而是整套能造工厂的工业体系，预估需运送至少百万吨物资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">火星殖民</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk delivers SpaceX update on Starship, Mars goals and more at Starbase RRR (Rapidly reusable, Reliable Rockets) hot staging orbital propellant transfer / orbital refilling gigabay\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-videofromspace-马斯克给火星殖民定了时间表-明年末发射-只有五五开胜算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa738aa7fb1d28dc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">39:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">VideoFromSpace</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克给火星殖民定了时间表：明年末发射，只有五五开胜算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星舰计划明年年底发射无人火星任务，但轨道推进剂转移这项从未实现的技术能否及时搞定，马斯克自己说胜算只有五五开。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">星舰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk speaks at Dubai&#x27;s World Government Summit Doge Grok 3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-01-ch-yahoo-finance-马斯克称退休档案堆满宾州矿井-是政府效率低下的缩影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c75be476da28f1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">36:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Yahoo Finance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克称退休档案堆满宾州矿井，是政府效率低下的缩影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国联邦退休审批靠人工填表、用矿井电梯运进地下矿洞存档，数字化项目已搞了11年仍只做到字母评级的B——马斯克用这个例子说明政府低效的根源是技术，不是单纯的预算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政府效率</span><span class=\"tag\">Grok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"86. 大模型季报年终特辑：和广密预言LLM产品超越Google之路 Long Horizon Task MCP Data Wall Reward Model K-Lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-22-zhangxiaojun-下一个google不是搜索-是任务引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1d93d02a587ff35f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>下一个Google不是搜索，是任务引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ChatGPT、Anthropic、Perplexity 形态各异，但都在争夺同一件事：重新组织信息与任务。搜索和推荐融合成任务引擎，谁掌握 context 谁就赢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"85. 与总统竞选成员聊，总统候选人与美国叙事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>总统大选就是给候选人找 PMF，产品不行谁也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大选团队是短期内 scale up 最快的组织，但产品（候选人）已经定了，能做的只是把产品和整个国家的环境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"84. 融了近4亿的AI创业者在干嘛？岂凡超的第一次访谈 conditioned generation RAG PMF MVP Foundation Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-10-zhangxiaojun-模型公司终将消失-产品公司才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f116fd554543d82-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司终将消失，产品公司才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">齐帆超认为模型本身没法直接产生价值，将来不存在模型公司；他融了近4亿却主动放弃训更大模型，转而解决大模型输出不确定性这个产品落地的最大卡点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"83. 黄仁勋和3万亿美元英伟达是如何炼成的？ CUDA Riva 128 pilot in charge Top5\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-04-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有二号位-黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/775b2d2a4ded4dbf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有二号位：黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达的战略不是规划出来的，是三个团队两个赛季、运送一整头牛这些战术被验证后固定下来的；但公司至今没有明显的二号位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的权力、技术哲学观与猫 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的权力，Crypto 是它的解药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 说 AI 的权力来自算力和数据，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解决人和人之间的信任问题，所以 AI 参与 Crypto 的游戏，而不是反过来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"81. 和李开复聊聊：如果美国形成AGI霸权，我们应该怎么办？ veneer Service as Software TCPMF HBM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-10-zhangxiaojun-第一个做出agi的必然是垄断者-中国只能走生态这条路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f3cfaffb1fad8fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>第一个做出AGI的必然是垄断者，中国只能走生态这条路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">追求第一个碾压对手的AGI，本质是商业霸权野心——他会用这个大脑发明手段维持垄断。中国公司打不过这场烧钱游戏，只能先把推理成本降下来，用生态当护城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI霸权</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"80. 和知乎周源聊，社会化编辑部、孤独的悖论、AI与宿命 PMF LTV NPC Perplexity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-31-zhangxiaojun-知乎的敌人不是抖音-是规模驱动的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc635d64ccaa69d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>知乎的敌人不是抖音，是规模驱动的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">周源复盘：上市后视频、短内容两次战略回撤，根因是把社区当规模生意做；社区只能生态驱动，溢出式增长，不能扩列式增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容社区</span><span class=\"tag\">AI搜索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"79. 特斯拉股价跌了，Uber却涨了？漫谈特斯拉Robotaxi大会 BOM CP / car partner Remote Assist option value 摇操作\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-13-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉发布会像年会-robotaxi-的故事讲给股东听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d92f23bc8afbb6e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉发布会像年会：Robotaxi 的故事讲给股东听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场发布会没有讲任何技术，更像给老股东开的年会。真正值钱的是它把车闲置时间变现的两条路：当 Robotaxi，或当分布式算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"78. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶5｜谈谈自动驾驶创投过山车这8年 SPAC PS ratio Gartner 曲线\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-08-zhangxiaojun-自动驾驶创投八年-起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26c9d4bb25a4059d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>自动驾驶创投八年：起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梦醒统计过，估值一亿美金以上的非资源型前沿科技公司，好像还没有很成功的案例。起步太高的公司会把钱花在维持卖相上，而不是猥琐发育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"77. 并购重组会兴起吗？和陆复斌聊他隐蔽做全球并购这5年 Two-Pizza Teams LBO CIFIUS AUM skin in the game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-05-zhangxiaojun-他出价51亿买雅虎-输给了45亿的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0794e105e21caea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>他出价51亿买雅虎，输给了45亿的对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陆复斌的offer比Apollo高6亿美金，却连一个答案都没拿到。五年后对方当面告诉他：你没有他们的高尔夫俱乐部会员。并购市场里，价格之外还有一层看不见的门槛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>"]